   'A Lebanese classic, reimagined. We took the muhammara found on every mezze table, warmed it with chili and paired it with high-protein fusilli for a satisfying, flavour-packed meal you can enjoy anywhere.',
   'MAGO-CUP-01', true, true, 2,
   '[{"name":"Roasted Red Peppers"},{"name":"Walnuts"},{"name":"Tomatoes"},{"name":"Chickpeas"},{"name":"Olive Oil"},{"name":"Garlic"},{"name":"Mediterranean Spices"}]',
   '{spicy}', 3, '{twirly}', '{quick-lunch,on-the-go,post-workout}', 'lebanese'),
  ('fusilli-al-pesto-genovese', 'Fusilli Cup', 'Al Pesto Genovese', 'Basil, parmesan & pine nut sauce',
