   'Fusilli in a fresh basil, parmesan and pine nut pesto.',
   'Fresh basil, real flavour, always a good idea. A bright Genovese-style pesto coats every spiral, with 30g of protein per cup.',
   'Inspired by the Ligurian coast, our pesto keeps things simple: fragrant basil, nutty parmesan and toasted pine nuts. It is the cup you reach for when you want something fresh and green.',
