  ('rishta-lentil-pasta-soup', 'Rishta Cup', 'Lentil & Pasta Soup', 'Lentils, caramelised onion, garlic, cumin & coriander',
   'Hearty, wholesome and full of flavour.',
   'A hearty Lebanese lentil and pasta soup with caramelised onion and warm spices.',
   'Hearty, wholesome and full of flavour. Lentils, caramelised onion, garlic, cumin and coriander meet tender pasta in a soup that tastes like home.',
   'Rishta is a winter staple in Lebanese kitchens: lentils and noodles simmered with onions and spices. We made it ready in minutes, without losing the comfort of the original.',
   'MAGO-CUP-03', false, true, 3,
   '[{"name":"Lentils"},{"name":"Caramelised Onion"},{"name":"Garlic"},{"name":"Cumin"},{"name":"Coriander"}]',
   '{soupy,comforting}', 1, '{brothy}', '{at-home,quick-lunch}', 'lebanese'),
  ('pastina-sweet-cinnamon', 'Pastina Cup', 'Sweet Cinnamon Milk Pasta', 'Creamy milk, cinnamon & brown sugar',
