   'A comforting classic with a joyful twist. Creamy milk, warm cinnamon and a touch of brown sugar turn tiny pastina into a sweet bowl of comfort.',
   'Sweet milk pasta is the kind of dish people remember from childhood. Our Pastina Cup brings back that feeling, ready whenever you need something soft, sweet and warming.',
