   '[{"name":"Milk"},{"name":"Cinnamon"},{"name":"Brown Sugar"}]',
   '{sweet,comforting}', 0, '{soft}', '{at-home}', 'fusion'),
  ('tagliolini-al-tartufo-bianco', 'Tagliolini Cup', 'Al Tartufo Bianco', 'Creamy white truffle sauce',
   'Creamy. Earthy. Pure indulgence.',
   'Silky tagliolini in a creamy white truffle sauce.',
   'Creamy, earthy, pure indulgence. A velvety white truffle sauce wraps around fine tagliolini for a little luxury in a cup.',
   'Truffle pasta usually means a special night out. We wanted that same indulgent, earthy flavour to fit into an ordinary weekday, ready in minutes.',
