   '{creamy}', 0, '{twirly,creamy}', '{at-home}', 'italian'),
  ('conchiglie-mac-and-cheese', 'Conchiglie Cup', 'Mac & Cheese', 'Creamy cheddar & cheese',
   'Rich. Creamy. Totally satisfying.',
   'Conchiglie shells in a creamy cheddar cheese sauce.',
   'Rich, creamy and totally satisfying. Little shells catch every bit of our creamy cheddar sauce.',
   'Mac and cheese is comfort food everywhere in the world. Our shells version is rich, cheesy and made to make any day feel a little cosier.',
   'MAGO-CUP-06', false, false, 6,
   '[{"name":"Cheddar"},{"name":"Cheese Blend"},{"name":"Parsley"}]',
