  ('tagliolini-al-limone', 'Tagliolini Cup', 'Al Limone', 'Creamy lemon butter sauce',
   'Bright. Zesty. Refreshing.',
   'Tagliolini in a creamy lemon butter sauce.',
   'Bright, zesty and refreshing. A creamy lemon butter sauce with parmesan and black pepper keeps every bite light.',
   'Pasta al limone comes from the lemon groves of southern Italy, a reminder that the simplest flavours are often the best. Ours is sunny, zesty and ready in minutes.',
   'MAGO-CUP-08', false, false, 8,
   '[{"name":"Lemon"},{"name":"Butter"},{"name":"Parmesan"},{"name":"Black Pepper"}]',
