   'Nutty, zesty and proudly Lebanese. Our tarator sauce blends tahini, garlic and lemon, finished with toasted pine nuts.',
   'Tarator is the tahini sauce served alongside fish and falafel across Lebanon. We turned it into a creamy pasta sauce with a crunch of pine nuts.',
   'MAGO-CUP-09', false, false, 9,
   '[{"name":"Tahini"},{"name":"Garlic"},{"name":"Lemon"},{"name":"Pine Nuts"}]',
